From cd27c3849204402491d557274bd3827daaa02c34 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 20:01:22 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Group homepage posts into lists (Master Thesis, AI Safety)

- Lists are defined in _data/lists.yml (id, name, description, order)
- A post joins a list with `list: <id>` in its header; posts without one go under "Other"
- Homepage shows one section per list, with All / per-list filter buttons;
  the chosen list is kept in the URL (e.g. /#ai-safety)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015sajfvtPmGkb5ceTztqXFY
